      "message": "I\u0027ll downgrade this to a nit. We didn\u0027t use to support bool in this codebase, so we have a lot of code that uses int where bool would be better. Now we support bool, so we try not to use int for bool in new code. However, people sometimes prefer to use int for consistency with the surrounding functions, which is valuable in its own way. You can leave this as int if you want.",
